M: I overslept. By the time I woke up, it was nine o''clock.
W: Oh no! Did you miss the bus?
M: Yes. By the time I got to the stop, the bus had already left.
W: What a morning! At least you''re here now.', '女:你看起来很累。今早怎么了?
男:我睡过头了。等我醒来,已经九点了。
女:糟糕!你错过公交车了吗?
男:是的。等我到站时,车已经开走了。
女:真是个糟糕的早晨!至少你现在到了。', 'us_male', '[{"q": "Why does the man look tired?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["He worked late.", "He was sick.", "He overslept.", "He ran far."]}, {"q": "What time did the man wake up?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Nine o''clock.", "Eight o''clock.", "Seven o''clock.", "Ten o''clock."]}, {"q": "What had happened when he got to the bus stop?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["The bus broke down.", "The bus was full.", "The bus was waiting.", "The bus had already left."]}, {"q": "Did the man miss the bus?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["No.", "He took a taxi.", "Almost.", "Yes."]}, {"q": "Is the man at work now?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["No.", "Yes.", "He is still on the bus.", "He went home."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', '9', 'U12');
It announced that aliens had landed on Earth.
Many people thought it was real news.
By the time they learned the truth, they had become frightened.
The show was a famous hoax.', '1938年,美国一档广播节目讲了一个奇怪的故事。
它宣布外星人已经在地球着陆。
许多人以为那是真实的新闻。
等他们得知真相时,已经吓坏了。
那档节目是一个著名的骗局。', 'us_female', '[{"q": "When did the radio show happen?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["In 1893.", "In 1983.", "In 2000.", "In 1938."]}, {"q": "What did the show announce?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["A storm was coming.", "A war started.", "Aliens had landed on Earth.", "A fire broke out."]}, {"q": "What did many people think?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["It was a joke.", "It was a song.", "It was an ad.", "It was real news."]}, {"q": "How did people feel by the time they learned the truth?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["Calm.", "Frightened.", "Bored.", "Happy."]}, {"q": "What was the show?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["A concert.", "A famous hoax.", "A weather report.", "Real news."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', '9', 'U12');
M: There''s a costume party today. Didn''t you know?
W: A costume party? No one told me about that.
M: Wait... everyone is in normal clothes. April Fool!
W: Oh no! You fooled me. How embarrassing!', '女:你为什么穿着化装服?
