On this day, people play jokes on each other.
The jokes are meant to be funny, not unkind.
No one knows for sure how the day began.
By the end of the day, people tell the truth about their jokes.', '愚人节是4月1日。
这一天,人们互相开玩笑。
这些玩笑是为了好玩,而不是不友善。
没人确切知道这个节日是怎么开始的。
到这一天结束时,人们会说出玩笑的真相。', 'us_female', '[{"q": "When is April Fool''s Day?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["On April 30th.", "On April 1st.", "On October 30th.", "On January 1st."]}, {"q": "What do people do on this day?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Play jokes on each other.", "Sing songs.", "Give gifts.", "Have a feast."]}, {"q": "What are the jokes meant to be?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Funny, not unkind.", "Sad.", "Scary.", "Mean."]}, {"q": "Does anyone know how the day began?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["No, not for sure.", "Yes, scientists.", "Yes, the writer.", "Yes, everyone."]}, {"q": "What do people do by the end of the day?", "type": "choice", "answer": "A", "options": ["Tell the truth about their jokes.", "Leave.", "Keep the joke.", "Win a prize."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', '9', 'U12');
